%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0fd4c3c83fae23b4cae61c12ce438472, type: 3}
  m_Name: Apothecary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Apothecary
  defaultPath:
    pathName: Introduction
    paragraphs:
    - You are the new farmer, right?
    - I do hope you didn't bring any of that mist in with you.
    emotions: 040000000500000005000000
  repeatedItemPath:
    pathName: 
    paragraphs: []
    emotions: 
  paths:
  - pathName: Buy something!
    paragraphs:
    - Anything handy?
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Want to buy this?
    paragraphs:
    - I see you got your eye on the {storeItemName}. It'll cost you {storeItemValue}
      <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color> <sprite index=0>! {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Sold!
    paragraphs:
    - Enjoy. {itemBought} {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: No Money
    paragraphs:
    - Come back with some more money and I can sell this to you.
    emotions: 03000000
  - pathName: No Space
    paragraphs:
    - I don't think you would be able to carry this.
    emotions: 05000000
  - pathName: Want To Trade for this?
    paragraphs:
    - I can make a {storeItemName} if you have the stuff for one. {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Not Enough Items
    paragraphs:
    - If you want these, you are gonna need to hand over some materials first.
    emotions: 03000000
  - pathName: SiegeWarning
    paragraphs:
    - Excellent! Here is the Titan Seed. {freezePlayer}
    - According to that scroll, you will need to protect the flower's exposed root
      nodes in addition to the plant itself.
    - Lose too many, and the flower will perish. Make sure you have plenty of water
      stocked up!
    - Fear not however. The more I make, the less flowers I will require to synthesize
      another.
    emotions: 01000000000000000500000001000000
  - pathName: Thanks for rescue
    paragraphs:
    - Hey there farmer! I got those new marigleam seeds ready for you! {freezePlayer}
    - ... What is that look for?
    - ... Huh? Am I ok? Why wouldn't I be?
    - ... Kidnapped? Farmer, with no due respect, I think you have been huffing the
      fog fumes too much! You are talking utter nonsense!
    - Here is something worth talking about! I recently found these new and shiny
      seeds! They appear to have properties similar to that of the marigleams.
    - For example, holding them up near the haze seems to dispel it! It is not super
      noticeable, but in high amounts I bet it could dissipate a good portion of
      it!
    - These could be crucial in removing high concentrations of isolated mist! If
      only I could remember where I found them...
    emotions: 01000000040000000400000005000000010000000000000001000000
  fillerPaths:
  - pathName: Aloe
    paragraphs:
    - It seems that the presence of the mist escalates varying attributes in the
      local plant life.
    - For instance, I have found that the Aloe that grows in the town has incredible
      restorative properties.
    emotions: 0000000005000000
  - pathName: Crows
    paragraphs:
    - 'The crows around here act very strange. Have you ever noticed how docile they
      become at dawn? '
    - The old farmer used to have so many horror stories, but I haven't seen them
      hurt anyone!
    emotions: 0500000001000000
  - pathName: Sacrifices for innovation
    paragraphs:
    - Mortality rates have undoubtidly increased since the azure haze arrived.
    - But with it has come new advancements in the medical field.
    - I like to think of those who lost their lives to this phenomenon, as making
      sacrifices for the greater good of humanity.
    emotions: 020000000500000000000000
  - pathName: Old people are stubborn
    paragraphs:
    - There are some folk in this town that stubbornly cling to their old ways of
      life.
    - How can they not see how enriched our lives have become?
    emotions: 0300000004000000
  - pathName: Save the forageables for me
    paragraphs:
    - I am on the lookout for some new floral specimens amongst the town to test
      some theories on.
    - I would kindly appreciate it if you stopped digging them up!
    emotions: 0000000003000000
  - pathName: Foxglove
    paragraphs:
    - At one point, VeilWood was abundant in Foxgloves; a flowering plant with small
      blooms.
    - I conducted research on it, and found it had an increased potency in it's poison.
    - Upon hearing the claim, she proceeded to uproot every last stalk of the plant,
      fearing someone would eat one by mistake.
    - Now, you cannot find a single trace of the flower in town.
    emotions: 00000000050000000000000002000000
  questPaths:
  - pathName: I figured it out
    paragraphs:
    - After lengthy research and testing, I have deduced a few things.
    - I was unable to synthesize the plant shown on that diagram. However, I was
      able to make dwarf versions of it.
    - I hypothesize that with enough samples of the smaller plant, I can recreate
      the larger one.
    - If you bring me enough specimens, then I may be able to bring this flower back
      from extinction.
    emotions: 00000000020000000000000001000000
  - pathName: Azure Rot Is Spreading
    paragraphs:
    - If you are looking for Marigleams, then you are going to have to wait. I have
      more pressing matters than making your pretty flowers!
    - This horrible black and blue rot has begun to infest my study! I cannot work
      under these conditions!
    - I have only seen this mold grow on the outskirts of the town, but it seems
      to be spreading.
    - I am going to run experiments on a potential fungicide. In the meantime, bring
      me some samples of the mist creatures showing more... potent symptoms. I have
      a theory...
    emotions: 02000000030000000400000000000000
  itemRecievedPaths:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - I don't have much use for something like that.
    - If you are looking to sell your stuff, I bet that weird wagon fellow will purchase
      it.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  itemSpecificRemarks:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - What do you take me for, a charity?
    - I have no need to spend my precious <color=#E0D38F> Mints</color> <sprite index=0>
      on your junk.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  - pathName: I will decrypt this scroll
    paragraphs:
    - What is this? The writing on this goes into such excruciating detail...
    - I have never seen or heard of this plant species before. Fascinating...
    - ...
    - Give me time. Come back tomorrow.
    emotions: 04000000040000000600000000000000
  friendshipPath1: []
  friendshipPath2: []
  friendshipPath3: []
  alreadySpoken:
  - pathName: ...
    paragraphs:
    - '...

'
    emotions: 06000000
  branchingPaths: []
  questCompletePaths:
  - pathName: Default Quest Complete
    paragraphs:
    - Thank you for completing my quest!
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Get me Puripulps
    paragraphs:
    - Excellent! These will work wonderfully.
    - I think I may have also found the perfect catalyst for this cure.
    - Deep in the woods lie a seed to a special crop. It's fruit seems to halt the
      spread of the rot.
    - ...Well?? You ARE the farmer! Get to farming!
    emotions: 01000000000000000000000005000000
  - pathName: Here is the cure
    paragraphs:
    - I've got it! I have concocted a cure!
    - Here, I will share the recipe with you, as well as give you some samples.
    - A single bottle should be able to clear a decent plot of infected land.
    - Now that my home is free of this putrid blight, I can get back to working on
      that new Marigleam.
    emotions: 05000000000000000000000001000000
  - pathName: Why did you have these samples?
    paragraphs:
    - Oh... Oh wow.
    - You just.... had those on you huh?
    - Right.... Well.... Thank you...
    - Um.... Anyways...
    - I think I may have also found the perfect catalyst for this cure.
    - Deep in the woods lie a seed to a special crop. It's fruit seems to halt the
      spread of the rot.
    - And I want FRESH samples. Not ones you left just sitting in your crates.
    emotions: 02000000040000000400000000000000050000000000000003000000
  dailyQuestPaths:
  - pathName: Daily Quest
    paragraphs:
    - Perfect timing! I was hoping you could help me out with something. {freezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
